:178,"height":196,"width_mm":20.782,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)用螺旋测微器测遮光条的宽度 d，如图乙所示，宽度 d 为 （填空）mm.\n(2)实验小组先进行一次试操作.让滑块遮光条中心到光电门中心的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 40.0\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 由静止释放滑块, 光电门测得滑块遮光条挡光时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t = 3.0\\times 10^{-3}\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 则该过程中, 系统重力势能减少量为 （填空） J, 系统动能增加量为 （填空） J. (结果均保留 3 位有效数字)\n(3)实验小组发现:这次试操作,在实验误差范围内,系统重力势能减少量与动能增加量不相等.导致上述结果的可能原因有（填空）.\nA. 滑块的质量没有远远大于槽码的质量\nB. 气垫导轨没有调水平,出现了左低右高的情况\nC. 气垫导轨没有调水平,出现了左高右低的情况\nD. 释放滑块时不小心给了滑块一个初速度\n(4)在滑块从静止释放到运动至光电门的过程中,若系统机械能守恒,则应满足的关系式为（填空）. (用题中所给的字母 m、M、g、L、d、t 表示)\n14 - Ⅱ. (7 分) 小明同学测量某金属丝的电阻率:\n(1)该同学用多用电表欧姆挡测电阻丝的阻值,当用“×10”挡时发现指针偏转角度过大,重新选择挡位并进行欧姆调零后,指针静止时位置如图甲所示,其读数为 （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":".\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7c54536e1e7947f9673d849291b82bff6ad8e9978a9f3ee253d7f99d0287696d.png","width":295,"height":208,"width_mm":34.637,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)为更精确测量金属丝的阻值 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小明同学从实验室找到了以下仪器设计实验方案：\nA. 电源电压恒为 E=3.0 V，内阻不计\nB. 电压表(0～3 V, 内阻约 3 k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"); (0～15 V, 内阻约 15 k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":")\nC. 电流表 A(0～0.6 A, 内阻约 0.125 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"); (0～3 A, 内阻约 0.0255 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":")\nD. 滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}(0\\sim5\\Omega,3\\mathrm{~A})"},{"type":"text","value":"\nE. 滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}(0\\sim1750\\Omega,3\\mathrm{~A})"},{"type":"text","value":"\nF. 开关 S、导线若干\n①为了调节方便,滑动变阻器应选用 （填空） (选填选项前的字母);\n②为使电阻的测量结果尽量准确且在调节电路的过程中电压表示数的变化范围足够大,请帮小明完成图乙实验电路接线（填空）;\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/aef9b8b0b569e62ea17ad797d7b3ca197e63b29c38ea4be5056046ad07523c26.png","width":325,"height":220,"width_mm":38.186,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n③利用该电路测量电阻,测量值与实际值相比 （填空） (选填“偏大”“偏小”或“不变”).\n(3)实验小组又对测量电路进行了创新.如图丙所示,在电阻丝上夹有一个可沿电阻丝滑动的金属触头P,触头的位置可从刻度尺上读出.实验时改变触头P与电阻丝接触的位置,多次改变电阻丝接入电路的长度l,调节滑动变阻器滑动触头的位置,使电流表的读数达到某一相同值I时,记录电压表的示数U,从而得到多个 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U}{I}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的值,作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U}{I}-l"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像,如图丁所示.如果已经测得电阻丝的直径为d,根据图丁所给数据,可得电阻丝的电阻率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）.（用a、b、c、d表示）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/116611d162af1b731abf4eafd79a13b839fdfacdc2647320c5a02e04aa713469.png","width":277,"height":267,"width_mm":32.441,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q14-row3"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/534dfea187631798d1e26d9f92f389dbf5d30d662ee687fe679196d7000432ff.png","width":202,"height":217,"width_mm":23.655,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q14-row3"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14 - I. (1) 4.076/4.077/4.078 mm/4.079 mm(1 分) (2) 0.0980(1 分) 0.104(1 分) (3) BD(2 分)\n(4)"},{"type":"math","value":"mgL=m\\left(\\frac{d}{2\\Delta t}\\right)^{2}+M\\left(\\frac{d}{\\Delta t}\\right)^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n解析:(1)螺旋测微器的读数在"},{"type":"math","value":"4.076 \\, mm \\sim 4.078 \\, mm"},{"type":"text","value":"都对;\n(2)系统重力势能的减少量为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mgL = 0.0980\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"; 系统动能的增加量为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} m\\left(\\frac{d}{2\\Delta t}\\right)^2 + \\frac{1}{2} M\\left(\\frac{d}{\\Delta t}\\right)^2 = 0.104\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":";\n(3) 发现系统重力势能的减少量为小于系统动能的增加量, 故选 BD;\n(4)满足重力势能的减少量等于系统动能的增加量，即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mgL = \\frac{1}{2} m\\left(\\frac{d}{2\\Delta t}\\right)^2 +\\frac{1}{2} M\\left(\\frac{d}{\\Delta t}\\right)^2."},{"type":"text","value":"14 - Ⅱ. (1)13(1 分) (2)①D(1 分) ②作图(2 分) ③偏小(1 分) (3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi d^{2}(b-c)}{4a}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2 分)\n解析:(1)倍率应该选“×1”,故读数为"},{"type":"math","value":"13 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"text","value":"(2)①由于电阻丝的总阻值大约为"},{"type":"math","value":"13 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，图乙电路图滑动变阻器采用分压式接法，为了调节方便，滑动变阻器选用最大阻值和被测电阻相近的"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故选 D.\n②为使电阻的测量结果尽量准确且在调节电路的过程中电压表示数的变化范围足够大，应选择分压式接法的电路，电流表采用外接法，所以电路图连线如图."},{"type":"figure","src":"images/df16e84da20061220fc5cbe27c156639c9a28227d7d179701f85cbef0035c8a3.png","width":319,"height":204,"width_mm":40.3},{"type":"text","value":"③外接法电流测量值偏大，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"R = \\frac{U}{I}"},{"type":"text","value":"可知，电阻测量值偏小.\n(3)根据欧姆定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x} + R_{\\mathrm{A}} = \\frac{U}{I}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由电阻定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x} = \\rho \\frac{l}{S} = \\frac{4\\rho l}{\\pi d^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U}{I} = \\frac{4\\rho l}{\\pi d^2} + R_{\\mathrm{A}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由图像斜率可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{b - c}{a} = \\frac{4\\rho}{\\pi d^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho = \\frac{\\pi d^2(b - c)}{4a}"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"30558c9013fb3579937e762f10fe10a556a55c8c41cbb09c80f16d649ef40be6","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8分)小龙同学设计了一种测温装置,其结构如图所示.球形烧瓶A为测温泡,内封有一定质量的理想气体,细管B连通水银柱,通过水银柱高度变化反映气体压强变化,从而实现温度测量.已知大气压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=75\\ cmHg"},{"type":"text","value":" .\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/17d28600296f9aae17ac8a112f3bce1ce073ac61d14a15440cf99b04dbadecb9.png","width":136,"height":276,"width_mm":15.883,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)初始时环境温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=27\\ ^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，细管内水银柱高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=15\\ cm"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求此时烧瓶内气体的压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；\n(2) 细管 B 横截面积忽略不计, 当环境温度变化后, 细管内水银柱高度变为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}=12\\ cm"},{"type":"text","value":" , 求此时的环境温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" (用摄氏温度表示);\n(3)在(2)中,若考虑细管 B 的横截面积,则实际环境温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}'"},{"type":"text","value":" （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" (选填“大于”“小于”或“等于”)."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. 解析：(1) 气体压强等于大气压强与水银柱产生的压强之差，即："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=p_{0}-\\rho g x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"以 cmHg 为单位直接叠加："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=75\\ cmHg-15\\ cmHg=60\\ cmHg"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n(2) 气体做等容变化，由查理定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_{1}}{T_{1}}=\\frac{p_{2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}=t_{1}+273\\ K=300\\ K,"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=p_{0}-\\rho g x_{2}=(75-12)\\mathrm{cmHg}=63\\mathrm{cmHg}."},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n代入查理定律得："},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=T_{1}\\cdot\\frac{p_{2}}{p_{1}}=300\\ K\\cdot\\frac{63}{60}=315\\ K"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n摄氏温度："},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=T_{2}-273\\ K=(315-273)^{\\circ}C=42^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(3) 大于 （2 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e76a3c4be682e7c77efa0322557bde205135dcaf3051b849c5b6689abaa20265","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11分)如图所示,质量m=1 kg的物块a从半径R=0.45 m的四分之一光滑圆弧轨道顶端A由静止滑下,圆弧轨道底端B与一水平传送带平滑连接,传送带长度L=1.5 m,以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=2\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" 的速度顺时针匀速转动,物块与传送带间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.2"},{"type":"text","value":" .传送带右端平滑连接一光滑水平面,水平面上有质量均为m=1 kg的物块b和c,物块b、c分别与一轻质弹簧栓连在一起,初始时弹簧处于原长.a与b碰后黏在一起,已知重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\ m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,求物块a:\n(1) 滑到圆弧轨道底端 B 时对轨道底端的压力大小 F；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1e8dda9c99388b0dc73963a6673455eb6cddfe7bdd71fa4ad96f22f9af8a8e51.png","width":563,"height":151,"width_mm":66.065,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)在传送带上运动的时间 t，以及到达传送带右端时的速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3) 运动过程中的最小速度和弹簧的最大弹性势能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}"},{"type":"text","value":" .\n【参考答案说明】第（3）问的最小速度，按配套原卷答案取 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 碰后阶段。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. 解析：(1) 物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 滑到 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时对轨道的压力\n物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 从 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 到 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"，由机械能守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"mgR=\\frac{1}{2} mv_B^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n代入 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=1\\,\\mathrm{kg}, R=0.45\\,\\mathrm m, g=10\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_B=\\sqrt{2gR}=3\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n在 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，由牛顿第二定律（向心力由支持力与重力的合力提供）："},{"type":"math","value":"F_N-mg=m\\frac{v_B^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n代入数据："},{"type":"math","value":"F_N=mg+m\\frac{v_B^2}{R}=30\\,\\mathrm N"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n由牛顿第三定律，物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 对轨道底端的压力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"30\\,\\mathrm N"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2) 物块在传送带上的运动时间和到达右端的速度\n物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 滑上传送带时速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_B=3\\,\\mathrm{m/s}>v_0=2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故先做匀减速直线运动，加速度由摩擦力提供 "},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\mu g=2\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n设减速到 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 的时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，由运动学公式 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0=v_B-at_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_1=\\frac{v_B-v_0}{a}=0.5\\,\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n减速阶段的位移 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_1=v_Bt_1-\\frac{1}{2} at_1^2=1.25\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_1=1.25\\,\\mathrm m<L=1.5\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"，剩余位移 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_2=L-x_1=0.25\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":" 做匀速直线运动，\n匀速时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_2=\\frac{x_2}{v_0}=\\frac{0.25}{2}\\,\\mathrm s=0.125\\,\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n总时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t=t_1+t_2=(0.5+0.125)\\,\\mathrm s=0.625\\,\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3) 物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 的最小速度和弹簧的最大弹性势能\n碰撞过程（"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 黏合），动量守恒 "},{"type":"math","value":"mv_C=(m+m)v_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n代入数据得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{ab}=\\frac{mv_C}{2m}=1\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n弹簧最大弹性势能："},{"type":"math","value":"a,b"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"c"},{"type":"text","value":" 通过弹簧相互作用，当三者共速时弹性势能最大。\n由动量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"(m+m)v_{ab}=(m+m+m)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n代入数据得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}}=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由机械能守恒，弹性势能等于系统动能的减少量："},{"type":"math","value":"E_p=\\frac{1}{2}(2m)v_{ab}^2-\\frac{1}{2}(3m)v_{\\text{共}}^2"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n代入数据："},{"type":"math","value":"E_p=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 的最小速度："},{"type":"math","value":"a,b"},{"type":"text","value":" 压缩弹簧后，弹簧恢复原长时 "},{"type":"math","value":"a,b"},{"type":"text","value":" 的速度最小，设此时 "},{"type":"math","value":"a,b"},{"type":"text","value":" 速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"c"},{"type":"text","value":" 速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_2"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n由动量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"2mv_{ab}=2mv_1+mv_2"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n机械能守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2m\\cdot v_{ab}^2=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2m\\cdot v_1^2+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot m\\cdot v_2^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n代入 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=1\\,\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{ab}=1\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_1=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即物块 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 的最小速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b2cefd4c23ca48f7ef700ffee2dfd9ca03894b45a05f469eefe458b417725e8d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12分)如图甲所示,两根相距 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=2.5\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的平行金属导轨固定在水平面内,左右两端各接一个 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=4\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 的定值电阻.质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=0.5\\ kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的导体棒a垂直导轨放置,与导轨良好接触.导轨间有两个足够大的匀强磁场区,磁感应强度大小均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B=0.8\\ T"},{"type":"text","value":" ,方向垂直导轨平面竖直向下;P、Q两虚线间为无磁场区域.导体棒在水平向右的外力F作用下,从O位置由静止开始运动,经5s从P点离开磁场,其电流随时间变化的图像如图乙所示.随后导体棒在无磁场区域继续运动,刚进入右侧磁场时撤去外力F(撤去外力F前,F随时间变化规律保持不变),再运动3.1m后恰好停下.已知导体棒电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r=2\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ,导轨电阻不计,求:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/316f7da52a3cf280959097865790bcbdbbea321e01758244f7ffadc9ba0a6149.png","width":392,"height":157,"width_mm":45.958,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q17-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0d021194dfd8b6c1e957f8fb7e0d44ed19d803caf9db7fdf06cc4fe86caa4e23.png","width":281,"height":243,"width_mm":36.315,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)0 至 5 s 内通过导体棒的电量及 OP 间的距离；\n(2) 写出水平力 F 随时间变化的表达式；\n(3) 导体棒 a 在无磁场区域内运动的时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(4)已知 0 至 5 s 内外力 F 做功为 1.92 J, 求整个过程中导体棒 a 产生的焦耳热."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. 解析：(1) 0 至5 s内通过导体棒的电量及 OP 间的距离\n①电量计算：由 "},{"type":"math","value":"I-t"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像可知，电量是 "},{"type":"math","value":"I-t"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像与时间轴围成的面积，即 "},{"type":"math","value":"q=1.25\\,\\mathrm C"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n②OP 间距离计算：电磁感应中，电量公式为 "},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\frac{BLx_{OP}}{R_{\\text{总}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，外电路总电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\text{总}}=r+\\frac R2=4\\,\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。代入得 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{OP}=\\frac{qR_{\\text{总}}}{BL}=2.5\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n(2) 水平力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 随时间变化的表达式\n由 "},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{BLv}{R_{\\text{总}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{IR_{\\text{总}}}{BL}=0.2t\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{\\mathrm dv}{\\mathrm dt}=0.2\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n安培力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}}=BIL=0.2t\\,\\mathrm N"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。由牛顿第二定律 "},{"type":"math","value":"F-F_{\\text{安}}=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"，得 "},{"type":"math","value":"F=0.2t+0.1\\,\\mathrm N"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n(3) 导体棒在无磁场区域内运动的时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n导体棒在 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_P=1\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"。进入右侧磁场后，由动量定理 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{B^2L^2}{R_{\\text{总}}}\\cdot x=mv_Q"},{"type":"text","value":"，代入数据得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_Q=6.2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n无磁场区域内，"},{"type":"math","value":"F=0.2t+0.1\\,\\mathrm N"},{"type":"text","value":"，对应图像的面积表示冲量，可得外力冲量 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_F=0.1t_1^2+1.1t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n由动量定理 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_F=m(v_Q-v_P)"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"0.1t_1^2+1.1t_1=0.5\\times(6.2-1)\\,\\mathrm{kg\\cdot m/s}\\Rightarrow t_1=2\\,\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n(4) 整个过程中导体棒 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 产生的焦耳热\n左侧磁场中：外力做功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W_F=1.92\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"，动能变化 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E_{k1}=0.25\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"，总焦耳热 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总}1}=1.67\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n导体棒产生的焦耳热 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q_1=0.835\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n右侧磁场中：动能变化 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E_{k2}=9.61\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"，总焦耳热 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总}2}=9.61\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n导体棒产生的焦耳热 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q_2=4.805\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。\n总焦耳热 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q=Q_1+Q_2=5.64\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bc5c40d859f40155b4809a3ed57265060638290db866c1292203370296341c1e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13分)如图甲所示,平行金属板M、N水平固定放置,两板间加有如图乙所示的周期性变化的电压,M、N板右侧的BAC区域内有竖直向上的匀强电场,M、N板的右端均在竖直边AB上,A点到M板的距离为h, "},{"type":"math","value":"\\angle A=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" .质量为m、电量大小为e的电子由静止开始,经电压也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电场加速后,连续不断地沿与M、N板平行的方向从两板正中间射入两板之间.所有电子都能从两板间飞出,且在两板间运动的时间均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2t_{0},t=0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻射入M、N板间的电子恰好从M板的右边缘飞出,已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}=\\frac{2mh^{2}}{et_{0}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,其中m,e,h, "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为已知量,不计电子的重力,求:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2af55aff370036fd0c64ec836293c894de8bd88f9fdc8b173dac54bf429a7bc0.png","width":444,"height":254,"width_mm":52.041,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/755a6b6acf5560d75f2d0749c007d8379995135b98da57ddb6f0cc147b8041ee.png","width":356,"height":202,"width_mm":41.734,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2512-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)金属板的板长；\n(2) "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 板间的距离；\n(3)要使所有的电子均不能从 AC 边射出, BAC 区域内的匀强电场的电场强度至少多大;\n(4)在(1)(2)的条件下,若将 BAC 区域改为垂直纸面向里磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{8m}{9et_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场,已知点 A 到 M、N 板右端的水平距离为 0 (即电子从板右端射出后立即进入磁场), AC 的长度足够长,求从 AC 边界射出磁场的电子占电子数量的百分比."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. 解析: (1) 设电子经加速电场加速后的速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":",\n根据动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"eU_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2eU_{0}}{m}}=\\frac{2h}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"则板长为"},{"type":"math","value":"L = v_{0} \\times 2 t_{0} = 4h"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(2)从 t=0 时刻进入 M、N 板间的电子在垂直于极板方向先做匀加速运动后做匀减速运动，设电子运动的加速度为 a，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"eE_{1}=ma_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n又"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1} = \\frac{U_{0}}{d}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据题意有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} d = 2\\times \\frac{1}{2} a_1t_0^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得，"},{"type":"math","value":"M,N"},{"type":"text","value":"板间的距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"d = t_0\\sqrt{\\frac{2eU_0}{m}} = 2h"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)由于所有电子经过 M、N 板的运动时间均为"},{"type":"math","value":"2t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，因此所有电子出 M、N 间电场时，速度均沿水平方向，且速度大小均为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{2h}{t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"要使所有电子均不从"},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":"边射出，则从"},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":"板边缘飞出的电子在电场中的运动轨迹刚好与"},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":"相切.设电场强度的大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则粒子在该电场中运动的加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"a_2 = \\frac{eE_2}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"根据题意，从"},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":"边缘飞出的电子运动到刚好与"},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":"相切的位置时，速度与水平方向夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据类平抛规律有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan 53^{\\circ} = \\frac{a_2t_2}{v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"x = v_{0}t_{2}, y = \\frac{1}{2} a_{2}t_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据几何关系有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan 37^{\\circ} = \\frac{x}{h + y}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n联立解得，BAC区域内的匀强电场的电场强度至少为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{2} = \\frac{16U_{0}}{9h} = \\frac{32mh}{9e t_{0}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/965ab1f7ad7f48cb35fdbcc063aad3665e1bb1f56ca2c16d0921a1b4bf4fabc0.png","width":408,"height":285,"width_mm":51.6},{"type":"text","value":"(4)设从距离 M 板为"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"的 P 点进入磁场的电子轨迹恰好与 AC 相切，\n此时满足的几何关系为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^{\\circ}=\\frac{r}{h+d_{y}+r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n洛伦兹力提供向心力："},{"type":"math","value":"ev_{0}B=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":",\n解得轨道半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{mv_{0}}{eB}=\\frac{9}{4}h"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{y}=\\frac{1}{2}h"},{"type":"text","value":"又 d=2h,"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/86aaf1192eb94e9e7fb51d18ba53b63acd746d8e891b5b8ad9ca78dd82a0faa3.png","width":393,"height":236,"width_mm":49.8},{"type":"text","value":"故从"},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":"边界射出磁场的电子占比为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta = \\frac{d_y}{d} = 25\\%"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}}]}
